  <activityDataset>
    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="baa01679-d555-5757-98a5-a8f989caf5e0" activityNameId="763e9e48-6028-5771-ac24-0810f471bd47" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Wrecking, transocean ship</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Wrecking, transocean ship
The emissions are determined based on the painted surface of a transoceanic vessel (10m2/LDT) and assumed LDT for transoceanic freight ship of 75000 LDT;
UUID: ae21353f-11c9-35ca-bd67-9d7b5f7ed663
This process includes all the energy required for the wrecking of a transoceanic vessel in India. Also included are all the waste and emissions which are caused due to the wrecking.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Average technology
Time period: Time of publications
Production volume: na
Sampling: Statistics 
Extrapolations: Some generic datasets from ecoinvent have been used.
Uncertainty adjustments: None
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_ae21353f-11c9-35ca-bd67-9d7b5f7ed663.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
